Error [E0969]: an `imports:` directive must be `find("<dir>")`
  --> env.jet:3:14
    |
  3 |     imports: gather("./modules")
    |              ^^^^^^
 Why: imports auto-discover a directory of modules (U4); the only directive is `find` with a single string-literal path, e.g. `find("./modules")`
 Fix: write `imports: find("./modules")`
